      "effects": [],
      "text": "Dance of Amity: After Bestial Ascent's Plunging Attack: Charmed Cloudstrider hits an opponent, Gaming will regain 1.5% of his Max HP once every 0.2s for 0.8s."
    },
    {
      "id": "gaming.passive2",
      "unlock": "p2",
      "effects": [],
      "text": "Air of Prosperity: When Gaming has less than 50% HP, he will receive a 20% Incoming Healing Bonus. When Gaming has 50% HP or more, Plunging Attack: Charmed Cloudstrider will deal 20% more DMG."
    },
    {
      "id": "gaming.passive3",
      "unlock": "p3",
      "effects": [],
      "text": "The Striding Beast: During the day (06:00 – 18:00), your party members gain the Swift Stride effect: Movement SPD increased by 10%.\nDoes not take effect in Domains, Trounce Domains, or Spiral Abyss. Swift Stride does not stack."
    }
